","header_size":"h2","align":"center","_title":"Heading","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary","typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=primary"}},"elements":[]},{"id":"a6866a","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Applying yarigai and kaizen to global content","header_size":"h4","align":"center","_css_classes":"ml-japan-sub","_title":"Subheading"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"a6c448","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>MacroLingo (formerly Scize Group) was founded in Fukuoka, Japan, and relocated to Osaka, Japan. The Japanese-ness is strong in us, despite the Western background. The customer is a god. Listen carefully and look at the whole situation. Relentlessly pursue quality. Value everything we do (<em>yarigai</em>). Seek and apply continual improvement (<em>kaizen</em>). These work ethics underpin all our work, no matter where the client is from. Yet, we don&rsquo;t neglect our heart, competitive spirit, and speed to implementation characteristic of the American work ethic (with a sprinkle of Aussie amiability and adaptability). We&rsquo;ll bring you the best of both worlds, for the whole world.</p>","_css_classes":"ml-prose ml-reveal ml-reveal-1","_title":"The passage","__globals__":{"text_color":"globals/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"a74004","elType":"container","settings":{"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"38","right":"30","bottom":"44","left":"30","isLinked":false},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"56","right":"30","bottom":"56","left":"30","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"42","column":"42","row":"42","isLinked":true},"flex_align_items":"stretch","_element_id":"clients","css_classes":"ml-rule-top ml-rule-bottom","_title":"Client logos"},"elements":[{"id":"a70226","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Our clients include&hellip;","header_size":"h3","align":"center","_css_classes":"ml-strip-title ml-reveal","_title":"Heading","_